      "text": "Incahuasi",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-mw9gatwi",
        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:8acf8036d7f35803",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "15c68b1750791083bf49e52e738e20a739dd152cc8e4c55032181b5af3d51f69",
      "text": "Breakfast. At 06:00, a private transfer takes you to the airport. The itinerary lists a Boliviana de Aviación flight from La Paz to Uyuni from 08:05 to 09:05. Flight times are confirmed at booking. Meet your driver at Uyuni Airport.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-mw9gatwi",
        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:d70678205dce905b",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0bfd8058c462b85b89a1d68e27102de1e5a95f2781e1cbe5a5fb6dd0099fe4bb",
      "text": "In Colchani, see how salt is processed using traditional methods. Visit the Playa Blanca Museum and the Ojos del Salar springs, and see the salt mounds and geometric patterns on the flats. Have a picnic lunch on the salt flats, then visit Incahuasi Island, where cacti grow up to 12 m tall. The day ends with sunset over the white plain.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-mw9gatwi",
        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:cf92b9d3d8e0a7db",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ec9f500e2718d2330411ab1a029986d26f4edf8b1ba321154049b0cfa1154ea2",
      "text": "The itinerary includes a transfer to Colchani and a night at the 3-star Casa del Sal. The hotel name and location are confirmed at booking. The salt flats are usually dry from April to November. From December to March, water may create a mirror effect. Access to Incahuasi depends on water levels and weather.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-mw9gatwi",
        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:fb4978a61bacd223",
