      "sourceTextSha256": "a257aa2201f1427402c9e7d20f2fc2e0c2b9710f2abe4618804244af6c66b9b1",
      "text": "White salt mounds on the salt flats near Colchani, Bolivia",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
